<item><title>CON # 26/33 New Footpath Construction (FY26/27)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the Construction of New Footpath in Highfield Lane (Rangiora) and Chinnerys Road (Woodend) between Woodglen Drive and Grange View reserve.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />Separable Portion A - Highfield Lane (Rangiora)<br /><br />- Construct 1.5 m wide Asphalt Footpath in Highfield Lane, Rangiora.<br /><br />- Installation of approximately 24 metres of 225mm dia uPVC stormwater pipe.<br /><br />Separable Portion B - Chinnerys Road (Woodend)<br /><br />- Construct 1.5m wide gritted Footpath in Chinnerys Road between Woodglen Drive and Grange View reserve.<br /><br />- Minor drainage improvements<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2709<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Srinath Srinivasan Email: srinath.srinivasan@wmk.govt.nz Tel: +64273430933<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=f99b279a552f453b95b39cbf6291ee36s2709s85818252ab0f4a97ad4749bb758701e4s12</link>
