<item><title>2026-27 Contractors Briefing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This is provision of information only. <br /><br />The Utilities and Roading annual Contractors briefing (2026/27) was held on 17th September 2026. This provided notification to contractors of upcoming works, and any changes in the Council's procurement or contracting approaches or any other operational process changes that may be of interest. <br /><br />This tender is to simply share the resultant presentation slides with you.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 31/Dec/2026 05:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2708<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Utilities, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
