<pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:57:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>25/64 Stopforth / Parsonage Road Realignment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Suitable Tier C Category 10 (Roading Improvements) prequalified Contractors are invited to tender for Contract 25/64 - Stopforth Road / Parsonage Road Intersection Realignment located in Woodend, Christchurch<br /><br />This Contract is for the realignment of Stopforth St and Parsonage Road in Woodend which is located in the Waimakariri District and includes the following;<br /><br />- Replacement and realignment of existing kerb and channel<br /><br />- Construction of new footpath<br /><br />- Residential entranceway reconstruction<br /><br />- Reconstruction of existing footpath<br /><br />- Reinstatement / construction of grassed berms<br /><br />- All road carriageway / pavement reinstatement including linemarking<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 05:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2696<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Glenn Kempton Email: glenn.kempton@wmk.govt.nz Tel: 0275859683<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
