<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Contract 26/67 High Street Rider Main Installation</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the installation of a new 63mm OD PE80 Full RC water rider main on the northern footpath of High Street Rangiora between King Street and Ashley Street. The pipe is to be sleeved inside of the abandoned DN150 stainless steel which is present under the footpath. The abandoned main has been investigated and found to be clear along its length without bends. Some heavy cleaning of the internal wall is to be undertaken as required to enable installation. Camera footage along the full length of the abandoned main is provided in the appendices. The contract includes several connections to the water network as described in the document.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2692<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=14a1e7993e444cf58bcf8cab33436eb5s2692</link>
