<item><title>North Drain Piping - Ashley to Edward Street</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the installation of a stormwater drain in the township of Rangiora.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />•	Supply and installation of the following stormwater infrastructure:<br /><br /> -	80m of concrete ducting 1250 series (1055 depth) with HN-HO-72 lids<br /><br /> -	450 sump as per Detail A, including coring into concrete ducting, cast in situ concrete infill, making good around penetrations and forming a neat finished connection.<br /><br /> -	3x manhole access frame and grate cast into concrete duct lid<br /><br /> -	Design and Build of Detail B cover for footpath use<br /><br />•	New footpath construction<br /><br />•	Trees cut down and ground to ground level<br /><br />•	Traffic Management<br /><br />•	Cutdown and reshape kerbs<br /><br />•	CCTV inspection<br /><br />•	Public notification and liaising with key stakeholders<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2687<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=8182642d558e4cfbbf993dad19c89d7fs2687</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">8182642d558e4cfbbf993dad19c89d7f</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:22:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
<item><title>Stormwater Treatment Devices Servicing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for inspections and servicing of proprietary stormwater treatment devices (filters) at scheduled intervals throughout the Waimakariri District.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />• Programming of device inspections and servicing<br /><br />• Installing traffic management<br /><br />• Confined space entry<br /><br />• Inspecting devices to evaluate treatment performance<br /><br />• Servicing devices to return them to optimum operation including:<br /><br />o installation of pipeline bungs/bags<br /><br />o pipeline de-watering<br /><br />o wet-well cleaning (water-blasting inside of chambers)<br /><br />o flushing inlets and outlets<br /><br />o removal & installation of cartridges for cleaning and/or replacing<br /><br />• Disposal of waste to consented disposal facility<br /><br />• Monthly reporting to the Engineer/Project Manager<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2686<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=bbf27283fd1441e59b9907db2d30497ds2686</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">bbf27283fd1441e59b9907db2d30497d</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:19:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies</category>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
